OL,3,ANew Zealand heads to polls
OL,4,
OL,5,FNew Zealanders are heading to the polls
OL,6,Fto elect a new government three years
OL,7,Fafter the last election
OL,9,FNearly 3.8 million people have enrolled
OL,10,Fto vote with about 25% of that number
OL,11,Fhaving cast their ballots already
OL,13,FNew Zealand's electoral system, known
OL,14,Fas Mixed Member Proportional (MMP),
OL,15,Fsees people cast two votes - one for a
OL,16,Fcandidate and the other for a political
OL,17,Fparty
OL,19,FThere has only been one majority
OL,20,Fgovernment under the system which was
OL,21,Fintroduced in 1996
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
